DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261008T190000
SUMMARY:Destin Fishing Rodeo: Daily Public Weigh-Ins
LOCATION:Docks behind AJ's Seafood & Oyster Bar\, 116 Harbor Blvd\, Destin\
 , FL 32541
DESCRIPTION:Daily\, Oct 1 – Oct 31 · 10:00 AM-7:00 PM\n\nAnglers competi
 ng in the month-long Destin Fishing Rodeo bring their catches to the scale
  on the harbor docks behind AJ's Seafood & Oyster Bar every day in October
 . The public is welcome to watch for free from 10 AM to 7 PM\, and the cro
 wd tends to grow with the size of the fish coming off the boats.\n\nPrice:
  Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-destin-rodeo-weig
 hins.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-destin-rodeo-weighins.html
CATEGORIES:Beach
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
