SUMMARY:Hermit Crab Races at CRABS on the Beach
LOCATION:CRABS on the Beach\, 6 Casino Beach Boardwalk\, Gulf Breeze\, FL 3
 2561
DESCRIPTION:Saturdays 10/10 and 10/17 · 5:00 PM and 6:00 PM\n\nCRABS on th
 e Beach races purple pincher hermit crabs in its playground on Saturday\, 
 October 10 and Saturday\, October 17\, with races at 5:00 PM and 6:00 PM. 
 The restaurant says it has run the races free of charge for smaller guests
  for 23 years. The crabs are native to Honduras and Chile and live in tree
 s near the ocean.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/
 events/ev-crabs-hermit-crab-races-1010.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-crabs-hermit-crab-races-1010.htm
 l
CATEGORIES:Beach
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
