DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:Charity Chili Cookoff and Volleyball Tourney on Navarre Beach
LOCATION:Juana's Pagodas & Sailors' Grill\, 1451 Navarre Beach Causeway\, N
 avarre\, FL 32566
DESCRIPTION:Sunday 10/11 · tastings 2:00 PM to 4:00 PM\, music 3:00 PM to 
 7:00 PM\n\nCaring and Sharing of South Santa Rosa County holds its 33rd an
 nual chili and salsa cookoff with a beach volleyball tournament at Juana's
  Pagodas. Tastings run 2:00 PM to 4:00 PM for a $20 donation at the door\,
  Goodbye August plays from 3:00 PM to 7:00 PM\, and winners and raffle pri
 zes are announced at 4:00 PM. The money buys holiday food for families in 
 South Santa Rosa County.\n\nPrice: from $20\n\nDetails: https://coastaleve
 ntures.com/events/ev-navarre-charity-chili-cookoff-1011.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-navarre-charity-chili-cookoff-10
 11.html
CATEGORIES:Beach
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
